The '''Grove of the Moon''' is one of the two druidic circles in [[Moonwhisper Coast]], along with the [[Grove of the Sun]]. Enclaves of the [[Cenarion Circle]], both circles represented the relationship between the night elves and tauren. However, the druids of the Grove of the Moon were subverted by the corrupted teachings of [[Arch Druid Mothshroud]] and his [[Shadewalkers]].

